 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Definitely. Sleep Sounds is an excellent one. It has soothing sound effects like waves or rain mixed with soft music. You can usually skip the narrative tracks and just listen to the sound effects. Lots of sleep mixes do just that. Roughly twenty minutes before your bedtime counts as wind down, so a short bedtime story audio or some gentle music helps. Then skip it. Lots of people skip it. Just use a nightlight instead. They last years on a single battery.",
